Hi Iain,

Yes, that's right.  The MSigDB gene sets are defined in terms of gene 
symbols, so you have no alternative but to annotate your features by gene 
symbol in order to define set membership.  Di Wu has given more detailed 
commentary of the steps in a separate email.

Best wishes
Gordon

