Cannot find Tcl/Tk package "BWidget".	affylmGUI cannot continue.

affylmGUI requires the Tcl/Tk extensions, BWidget and Tktable.
You must have Tcl/Tk installed on your computer, The
Tcl/Tk installation which comes with R includes BWidget and Tktable.	 
If you do have
Tcl/Tk installed elsewhere, including the extensions, make sure that R  
can find the path to the
Tcl library, e.g. C:\Tcl\lib (on Windows) or /usr/lib (on Linux/Unix)
or /sw/lib on Mac OSX.

Set the environment variable TCL_LIBRARY to the appropriate path. for  
eg.
C:\Tcl\lib\tcl8.4
and set the MY_TCLTK environment variable to a non-empty string, e.g.  
"Yes".

If using Windows, read the R for windows FAQ at
http://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/base/rw-FAQ.html
If your Tcl/Tk extensions still can't be found, try
addTclPath("<path to Tcl library>").
