Message-ID: <loom.20101130T231354-239@post.gmane.org>

Hi Paul

> Can anyone recommend a way to derive a list of oncogenes (even an inexact
list) from the annotation
> packages, org.Hs.eg or something else?
> 
> Thanks.
> 
>  - Paul

As far as I am aware of this is not currently possible. You could look up
"oncogene" at the NCBI Gene site and save the result as a list of Entrez Gene
IDs (UID) which can easily be integrated with the BioC annotation packages for
further analysis.

Best wishes.
James.


