Finally, after a lot of brainstorming, (mostly) fixed Turned out to be a 
permissions issue: because I installed EBImage as root, group and other 
execute permissions were not set.

Tried:

chmod -R a+rx /Library/Frameworks/R.framework/Resources/library/EBImage
chmod -R g+w /Library/Frameworks/R.framework/Resources/library/EBImage

and now no problem loading from R invoked in an X11 or Terminal window, 
though R64.app still hangs on:

library(EBImage)

Do I still have some permissions wrong?

